00:29:10.610 --> 00:29:14.590
This is actually, we always
say, most of the time,

00:29:14.590 --> 00:29:18.700
that group velocity is the
one you calculate transport.

00:29:18.700 --> 00:29:21.640
They are trickier cases
where this becomes very--

00:29:21.640 --> 00:29:24.190
this is actually not right.

00:29:24.190 --> 00:29:27.310
And if you check the literature
over probably the last 15

00:29:27.310 --> 00:29:29.470
