00:31:10.410 --> 00:31:16.950
And when this
varies very rapidly,

00:31:16.950 --> 00:31:23.220
when this omega 0 omega
over k varies very rapidly,

00:31:23.220 --> 00:31:27.720
and those quantities is a
strong function of omega k,

00:31:27.720 --> 00:31:34.820
so you cannot pull out and
do the analysis we do here.

00:31:34.820 --> 00:31:39.370
So in that case, there is
actually a so-called signal

00:31:39.370 --> 00:31:41.380
