00:32:33.630 --> 00:32:42.160
And so anyway,
that's a sidetrack.

00:32:42.160 --> 00:32:45.590
So that's why when we
do the calculation,

00:32:45.590 --> 00:32:47.810
we will use the group velocity.

00:32:47.810 --> 00:32:53.810
So we have now the answer to
