00:32:53.810 --> 00:32:55.870
Say how fast?

00:32:55.870 --> 00:32:57.940
That's group velocity.

00:32:57.940 --> 00:33:00.550
Say how many?

00:33:00.550 --> 00:33:02.320
Density of states.

00:33:02.320 --> 00:33:07.510
And each state, the
